# ── financial security ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Deployment-injected finance configuration (endpoint, timeouts).
# A private deployment writes this file at deploy time; it must
# NEVER be committed — the public build ships without it and the
# dashboard falls back to fictional sample data.
dashboard/finance-config.js

# Private financial exports must never enter this repository.
*.ofx
*.qfx
*.qbo
bank-export*
statement*.csv
transactions*.csv

# ── intellectual property security ─────────────────────────────
# Deployment-injected IP configuration (endpoint, mode). A private
# deployment writes this file at deploy time; it must NEVER be
# committed — the public build ships without it and the dashboard
# falls back to fictional sample IP metadata.
dashboard/ip-config.js

# Proprietary IP documents must never enter this repository:
# manuscripts, frameworks, curricula, assessments, research,
# contracts, and legal documents live only in private encrypted
# storage. Anything staged under these names is refused.
ip-private/
manuscript*
*-manuscript.*
curriculum-content*
assessment-questions*
contract*.pdf
contract*.docx
legal-doc*

# ── general ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.DS_Store
